Hunter you will get to know and try out different ways of digging for gold.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stronger together</h2>Work together with friends on a claim to experience and celebrate success together. Or work with friends on a server in different companies and on different claims. Hire out equipment, place orders, or take orders yourself so that your expensive machines don't rust.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">There is a lot to do</h2>Gold Hunter puts a lot of emphasis on making the simulation of gold prospecting an experience. However, this also means that all activities and steps have to be carried out by yourself! Equipment has to be set up and adjusted. Levers and buttons have to be operated yourself, containers have to be filled manually, defective equipment has to be repaired and maintained. So when there is something to do, the player is challenged!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Distraction</h2>And when you need a break, you can spend the time with various leisure activities, or explore the huge map and find places that are not in any travel guide.",
